WEBVTT

00:08.380 --> 00:09.330
Father!

00:09.330 --> 00:10.290
Lord Marquis!

00:10.460 --> 00:12.710
Liselotte, lend me a hand!

00:19.790 --> 00:20.580
Fiene?!

00:21.080 --> 00:23.130
Fiene, where are you?!

00:27.540 --> 00:28.250
Mommy?

00:28.880 --> 00:29.420
What?

00:34.250 --> 00:35.210
Fiene!

00:37.630 --> 00:38.630
Mommy!

00:38.790 --> 00:41.460
Whaaaat?!

00:42.210 --> 00:45.750
Please notice these feelings I can't tell you

00:45.750 --> 00:51.880
I'll try to make you see with these skewed and clumsy words

00:52.130 --> 00:55.040
Just for you

01:04.330 --> 01:07.290
I always hide what I mean

01:07.290 --> 01:09.710
(so you don't realize my heart is pounding)

01:09.790 --> 01:14.920
It's all your fault for being far too stunning

01:15.170 --> 01:17.960
No way I can be cute

01:17.960 --> 01:19.710
(I mean, that's not me, is it?)

01:19.710 --> 01:22.540
Even the sky reflected in those eyes

01:22.540 --> 01:25.830
I can't bear to gaze at it straight on

01:25.830 --> 01:31.170
How long am I going to live in this world full of lies?

01:31.170 --> 01:36.080
I'll never manage to change anything at this rate

01:36.250 --> 01:38.790
I don't want that to happen

01:38.790 --> 01:44.960
Even if a god were to speak for me and tell you how I feel

01:44.960 --> 01:50.250
Someday, I want to tell you in my own words that I love you

01:50.500 --> 01:59.000
Even if the words are skewed,
before this precious feeling disappears somewhere

01:59.500 --> 02:02.210
I promise I'll find the courage

02:12.710 --> 02:16.330
<b>Chapter 5</b>

02:12.710 --> 02:16.330
<b>Mother and Daughter, Sisters, and a First Date</b>

02:13.710 --> 02:15.750
Fiene, you're all right!

02:16.580 --> 02:18.750
And that completes the roster!

02:19.130 --> 02:24.830
Well, I wanted that to sound dramatic, but I've gotta
admit I didn't expect the cast to assemble quite like this.

02:26.750 --> 02:29.750
But, um...what are you doing in that nice dress?

02:30.130 --> 02:32.500
Your skin's glowing and you look just fine.

02:32.500 --> 02:35.830
I thought you were being bullied by that Riefenstahl girl?

02:36.210 --> 02:40.290
This dress is a hand-me-down from
Lady Lieselotte fixed up nicely to fit me,

02:40.290 --> 02:43.040
and they provide me with amazing meals every day.

02:43.960 --> 02:48.040
Lady Lieselotte is too kindhearted
to be capable of bullying anyone,

02:48.250 --> 02:50.500
and besides, she and I are friends!

02:51.880 --> 02:52.790
Fiene...

02:53.380 --> 02:57.420
Ooh, I see Lieselotte trying hard to suppress a grin!

02:58.000 --> 03:01.710
She did seem really happy recently
getting to know Fiene better.

03:02.250 --> 03:07.920
Oh, and the fact that most of the dresses she gave Fiene
are actually brand new is supposed to be a secret!

03:09.580 --> 03:12.460
Forgive me, but may I ask you your age?

03:12.460 --> 03:15.460
Huh...? Oh, um... I'm fifteen years old...

03:15.630 --> 03:17.830
Then my suspicions must be true.

03:18.710 --> 03:21.960
Indeed, you have the same eyes.
The same sky blue eyes.

03:23.540 --> 03:25.630
I'm very glad to meet you, young lady.

03:25.630 --> 03:31.330
My name is Bruno Riefenstahl, the head
of this house and Lieselotte's father.

03:31.330 --> 03:32.210
As well as...

03:34.130 --> 03:37.170
...your father's younger brother.

03:39.540 --> 03:46.880
Fiene's father is August Riefenstahl, the marquis's
older brother who passed away sixteen years ago.

03:47.580 --> 03:48.920
So they're cousins?!

03:49.210 --> 03:50.000
That's right!

03:50.380 --> 03:53.790
Lieselotte and Fiene are cousins by blood.

03:54.250 --> 03:58.750
And Fiene's mother Elizabeth,
who was causing a ruckus just moments ago,

03:58.750 --> 04:03.790
was once known as the Fae Princess of the Marschner
Duchy, a prestigious house with ties to royal blood.

04:03.790 --> 04:04.670
What?!

04:14.750 --> 04:17.080
<b>Riefenstahl Castle-Castle Gates</b>

04:14.750 --> 04:17.080
<b>Fiene</b>

04:14.750 --> 04:17.080
<b>Mommy...</b>

04:15.000 --> 04:19.710
The fact that they're cousins has
never been revealed this way before.

04:20.380 --> 04:26.130
The Fae Princess... A most eminent maiden who
captivated high society with her delicate beauty.

04:26.540 --> 04:31.040
She disappeared after losing her one true love,
and even now over a decade later,

04:31.460 --> 04:36.040
her tragic romance and fairy-like appearance make
for an enduring tale among those in high society.

04:36.210 --> 04:37.330
That Fae Princess?

04:39.580 --> 04:46.670
I heard that my Fiene was being cared for here
and came to extend my respects and gratitude.

04:46.880 --> 04:52.670
Dearest Sister! By which you mean you destroyed
the castle gates to break in and retrieve Miss Fiene,

04:52.670 --> 04:56.130
and you were even prepared to resort
to violence if necessary, were you not?!

04:57.250 --> 05:03.290
Miss Fiene, your father August was
a mild-mannered and kind older brother.

05:03.540 --> 05:05.580
But he had a frail constitution,

05:06.000 --> 05:10.540
so much that the family doubted he would
live long enough to take over our house.

05:10.670 --> 05:15.580
August and I were betrothed at an early age
and grew to love one another.

05:20.210 --> 05:24.830
But by the time I was of an age
eligible to marry, it was too late.

05:25.330 --> 05:26.710
Elizabeth...

05:27.040 --> 05:29.330
Please, forget about me.

05:29.710 --> 05:33.250
No, I refuse to leave your side.

05:34.250 --> 05:36.210
But my family thought otherwise.

05:36.670 --> 05:38.580
They saddled us with a worthless burden.

05:38.580 --> 05:42.790
No, we agreed to wed Elizabeth
to the head of their house.

05:42.790 --> 05:46.040
Then we shall have her marry the younger brother Bruno.

05:46.290 --> 05:52.460
Elizabeth is a precious pawn. We must see to it that
she becomes the next marquise of House Riefenstahl.

06:07.790 --> 06:09.420
Elizabeth...?

06:09.830 --> 06:11.920
I don't care if we can't get married.

06:12.210 --> 06:13.040
So please...

06:15.000 --> 06:16.000
August!

06:16.290 --> 06:20.290
It was only after August's death
that I realized I was pregnant.

06:20.960 --> 06:23.380
I suppose I shouldn't be talking
about this in front of my daughter.

06:24.540 --> 06:29.380
If House Marschner found out, I was certain
they would order to have the child killed along with me,

06:29.630 --> 06:32.580
so I stole as many valuables as
I could find from my house and took off.

06:33.210 --> 06:38.380
Ever since, I spent years on the run to protect Fiene.

06:39.130 --> 06:40.130
But then...

06:40.710 --> 06:41.580
Fiene?!

06:43.750 --> 06:44.750
Fiene...?

06:46.080 --> 06:46.960
Mommy...

06:47.210 --> 06:49.790
I just lashed out and I think I knocked them all out...

06:51.330 --> 06:55.750
That's when I realized that my little girl was going to be
fine.

06:57.460 --> 07:03.000
So I left Fiene under the academy's
protection and went into hiding.

07:12.380 --> 07:14.380
So that's what happened...

07:15.960 --> 07:18.460
Why did you not think to tell me?!

07:18.790 --> 07:21.580
I would have used all of House Riefenstahl's might

07:21.580 --> 07:24.830
to completely annihilate any enemies
of my brother and his wife and child!

07:28.170 --> 07:30.080
Uh, yeah, that's why.

07:30.460 --> 07:34.290
An all-out war between two major
noble families is a horrible idea!

07:34.630 --> 07:38.330
As if I'd ever want me or Fiene
to trigger that kind of conflict.

07:39.670 --> 07:43.460
Well, Fiene's safe as long as she's at the academy,

07:43.580 --> 07:48.460
and I was hoping you might snag a nice boy there
who'll take you under his protection!

07:48.790 --> 07:49.460
Huh?!

07:49.670 --> 07:53.630
Well, because once House Marschner
realizes they can't kill you,

07:53.630 --> 07:57.330
they'll probably say they want to use you
a pawn in some political marriage.

07:57.460 --> 07:59.290
Maybe, but that's ridiculous!

08:00.250 --> 08:04.880
Hmm, I seem to recall a certain boy
who would gladly take her in.

08:04.880 --> 08:09.420
His name starts with "B" and ends in "r."
Personally, I think he's a great catch!

08:09.790 --> 08:10.630
Huh?!

08:12.170 --> 08:16.420
No, there is no time to wait idly by for a suitor to appear.

08:18.380 --> 08:19.000
Miss Fiene.

08:19.330 --> 08:20.330
I think it best for you...

08:21.330 --> 08:23.380
to become my sister.

08:24.170 --> 08:25.000
What?!

08:26.500 --> 08:31.330
Father, I implore you to adopt Fiene
into our family straight away,

08:31.630 --> 08:36.830
and name her as the rightful heir of House Riefenstahl.

08:37.380 --> 08:38.750
Lady Lieselotte!

08:39.210 --> 08:45.920
True, I would gladly welcome my older brother's
daughter as my heir, but we already have Baldur.

08:46.250 --> 08:52.830
If you mean my fool of a cousin, I hear he is wooing
Miss Fiene here with no heed for his duty as heir.

08:54.960 --> 08:56.540
Ah, is that so?!

08:57.790 --> 09:03.710
I'm sure that moronic cousin of mine would gladly
give up his right to succeed for his beloved Miss Fiene.

09:04.330 --> 09:10.330
Then if you declare that whoever weds Miss Fiene
will be the next marquis, Father,

09:10.460 --> 09:13.710
not even House Marschner should
be able to lay their hands on her.

09:13.710 --> 09:15.080
Hmm, indeed!

09:15.080 --> 09:21.040
If the idiot manages to woo Miss Fiene that's all very well,
but if not he only has his own shortcomings to blame.

09:21.040 --> 09:22.960
I don't see a problem with that!

09:23.580 --> 09:24.880
"Idiot"...?

09:29.750 --> 09:34.630
A failure who falters in charming the woman of
his dreams is not fit to be marquis in the first place!

09:34.960 --> 09:39.210
It would befit such a man to humbly serve
the kingdom as an ordinary knight!

09:41.670 --> 09:45.040
Wow, you've got the villainess act down pat, Lieselotte!

09:45.040 --> 09:51.000
But knowing that under all that lies her love for
Fiene and her trust in Baldur, it's so sweet it hurts!

09:51.000 --> 09:53.790
Oh Liese-tan, you're the bestest ever!

09:55.290 --> 09:56.460
Lieselotte...

09:57.000 --> 10:02.130
Hold on, now! Who do you think will actually
believe that Fiene is August's daughter?

10:02.420 --> 10:03.670
I have no proof.

10:03.670 --> 10:04.920
Th-that's right!

10:05.250 --> 10:09.210
It's so sudden, I can't believe I'm a noble as it is.

10:10.920 --> 10:13.630
All we need is some kind of proof, right?

10:14.080 --> 10:15.540
Artur Richter...

10:16.290 --> 10:18.170
Marriage is governed by the Church.

10:18.830 --> 10:25.500
If we can find a record of Fiene's parents making their
wedding vows sixteen years ago, that should do the trick.

10:26.540 --> 10:30.040
If I take a look I'm pretty sure I'll find it somewhere.

10:30.670 --> 10:32.170
Does he mean by fabricating proof?!

10:32.880 --> 10:34.290
Very true.

10:34.920 --> 10:38.380
And old records are liable to get lost at times.

10:38.380 --> 10:42.500
Liese-tan took the bait! Who would've
thought she'd ever team up with Art?

10:43.250 --> 10:45.250
I'm surprised we're seeing eye-to-eye, for once.

10:46.790 --> 10:51.790
Uh, then I suppose I should take a look
over in the royal records, perhaps.

10:51.790 --> 10:53.750
Whoa! And now Sieg's in on it!

10:53.460 --> 10:58.960
<b>Whisper</b>

10:53.460 --> 10:58.960
<b>Whisper</b>

10:53.460 --> 10:58.960
<b>Deliberating</b>

10:53.750 --> 10:56.580
The three of them are conspiring together
to hatch some kind of scheme!

10:56.580 --> 10:58.960
But only because they care about Fiene, of course!

11:03.250 --> 11:05.420
I want you to consider this in simple terms.

11:06.250 --> 11:10.210
Is the thought of becoming my little sister... unpleasant?

11:12.710 --> 11:14.920
Of course not!

11:15.580 --> 11:19.420
Lady Lieselotte, you're so elegant but
also cute when you're with His Highness.

11:19.420 --> 11:21.330
Sometimes you're overly prickly

11:21.330 --> 11:25.670
but lately I find that gap endearing,
so endearing that it doesn't seem fair,

11:26.500 --> 11:29.540
so what I mean is... I adore you!

11:30.500 --> 11:33.830
Lieselotte is flustered beyond reason
by Fiene's barrage of compliments!

11:33.830 --> 11:37.330
You'd better watch out, or she'll really
steal Liese-tan away from you!

11:37.630 --> 11:38.290
What?!

11:38.750 --> 11:42.170
Oh, but... I don't have what it takes
to be the next marquise...

11:42.460 --> 11:44.710
I'll be right by your side, Miss Fiene.

11:45.080 --> 11:47.210
As well... as everyone else.

11:49.880 --> 11:51.170
Lady Lieselotte...

11:51.630 --> 11:54.330
My, aren't you going to call me your sister?

11:55.630 --> 11:57.130
M-my dear sister!

11:57.580 --> 12:03.000
I've always been an only child, and we moved
around so much that I hardly ever made friends.

12:03.330 --> 12:06.830
So I'm so incredibly happy to have a sister like you!

12:07.750 --> 12:13.170
I'm glad as well. At long last,
I have a little sister who's sweet and sincere.

12:15.000 --> 12:17.330
Ooh, Sieg looks conflicted over this!

12:17.580 --> 12:22.290
I would say this is an expression of sisterly love.
I don't believe it's a yuri route... at least probably.

12:23.710 --> 12:26.000
"Yeux lis" route? What is that?

12:27.170 --> 12:29.790
I'm so happy! So happy for them!

12:30.330 --> 12:31.580
Yeah, it's great.

12:31.580 --> 12:33.790
And I'm impressed you managed
to keep that in, Kobayashi.

12:33.960 --> 12:35.580
It was a struggle.

12:35.580 --> 12:38.750
Me sniffling in the background
would've totally ruined the moment!

12:38.750 --> 12:40.960
I'm amazed you're that affected by this.

12:41.920 --> 12:45.830
I mean, this never could've happened
in the existing storylines.

12:42.130 --> 12:46.130
<b>Love Me</b>

12:42.130 --> 12:46.130
<b>Magically!</b>

12:46.210 --> 12:48.710
When Fiene finds out she's Liese-tan's cousin,

12:48.710 --> 12:52.130
aside from the Reverse Harem Route,
it's always after Liese-tan dies.

12:52.380 --> 12:55.460
Oh Magikoi, you and your brutal storylines!

12:55.460 --> 13:00.250
So I never thought I'd see them smiling
and looking so happy together!

13:01.170 --> 13:04.580
I know! We should go somewhere tomorrow to celebrate!

13:04.580 --> 13:05.380
Huh...?

13:05.830 --> 13:10.920
To celebrate Lieselotte and Fiene becoming sisters,
we should go out to eat something nice together!

13:11.210 --> 13:12.670
We'll take a break from the game for the day.

13:12.670 --> 13:15.500
O-okay, I guess that could be nice for a change.

13:15.790 --> 13:18.540
Then it's settled! Tomorrow, we go out!

13:19.790 --> 13:20.880
It's a date!

13:22.080 --> 13:22.710
A...

13:25.710 --> 13:26.790
A date?!

13:29.290 --> 13:34.880
For this week's feature we welcome the hottest
dreamboat actor in the spotlight right now, Kirise Kuon!

13:32.000 --> 13:35.040
<b>Daily A.M.</b>

13:32.000 --> 13:35.040
<b>Special Feature!</b>

13:32.000 --> 13:35.040
<b>It's a</b>

13:32.000 --> 13:35.040
<b>beautiful</b>

13:32.000 --> 13:35.040
<b>day for</b>

13:32.000 --> 13:35.040
<b>going out!</b>

13:32.010 --> 13:35.040
<b>Who is the most</b>

13:32.010 --> 13:35.040
<b>popular</b>

13:32.010 --> 13:35.040
<b>pop star actor</b>

13:32.010 --> 13:35.040
<b>right now?</b>

13:35.670 --> 13:37.540
Thank you for always supporting me.

13:38.210 --> 13:40.540
You're looking very sharp today, as always.

13:40.540 --> 13:42.500
<b>Kirise Kuon</b>

13:40.540 --> 13:42.500
<b>Always the reliable fashion icon!</b>

13:40.960 --> 13:42.830
That's very kind of you.

13:42.830 --> 13:46.830
I really should have made it a habit
to check out fashion magazines and stuff.

13:46.830 --> 13:47.960
Endo!

13:52.130 --> 13:54.290
Sorry, I'm a bit late.

13:54.290 --> 13:55.170
Ack, uh...

13:59.670 --> 14:03.750
Are you kidding? You're so cute. That's way
too adorable, Kobayashi. What do I do?

14:03.750 --> 14:04.920
Uh... um...

14:05.080 --> 14:08.040
Wh-what's this all of a sudden, Endo?

14:08.380 --> 14:10.540
Um, I'm sorry I made you wait.

14:10.790 --> 14:14.580
Uh, no! I got here way too early.
There's still five minutes to go.

14:14.790 --> 14:18.880
And I'm sure you spent a lot more time
getting ready to dress up that nicely.

14:18.880 --> 14:21.250
So what I'm trying to say is if anyone's late, it's me!

14:21.630 --> 14:22.920
Okay...

14:22.920 --> 14:25.920
But man, I'm sorry. I'm just dressed the same as usual.

14:25.920 --> 14:31.500
Oh, but with your athletic build you look
plenty cool in a simple outfit like that.

14:32.290 --> 14:33.250
What are you, an angel?!

14:33.710 --> 14:35.630
What? Don't tease me like that!

14:36.040 --> 14:39.710
No, really... you're cute. Super cute.
Honestly, so cute it's angelic.

14:40.500 --> 14:41.540
Really?

14:41.790 --> 14:44.210
Yes! Seriously cuter than anyone in the entire world!

14:45.500 --> 14:46.630
Aw, thanks.

14:49.710 --> 14:52.290
That smile, right now? Are you a goddess?!

14:52.290 --> 14:55.290
<b>The Royal Academy of Magic-Dining Hall</b>

14:52.290 --> 14:55.290
<b>Siegwald</b>

14:52.290 --> 14:55.290
<b>Lady Kobayashee</b>

14:52.630 --> 14:54.460
Oh right, you actually are.

14:55.790 --> 14:59.540
Jeez, I definitely should have worn
something as nice as yours.

15:00.000 --> 15:03.630
Then how about after we eat,
we go and take a look at some clothes for you?

15:03.630 --> 15:06.000
Whoa, that's very kind of you, Goddess!

15:06.130 --> 15:11.000
Oh well, I'm kinda indebted to the god Endo,
and you can wear them the next time.

15:11.170 --> 15:13.000
Th-there's a next time?!

15:13.000 --> 15:15.920
Then come on, let's get going to our lunch place.

15:15.920 --> 15:17.630
We'll miss our reservation!

15:17.630 --> 15:18.750
Oh, yeah...

15:21.500 --> 15:22.330
Eve?

15:24.130 --> 15:25.170
Let's take a shortcut.

15:25.420 --> 15:26.210
Sure.

15:27.790 --> 15:30.080
It's just through here. I can't wait!

15:31.210 --> 15:32.000
Eve!

15:34.330 --> 15:36.330
What? Uh, let me go!

15:36.630 --> 15:37.460
Eve!

15:38.290 --> 15:39.250
"Eve"...?

15:47.960 --> 15:49.830
What business do you have with her?!

15:51.290 --> 15:52.460
She's not Eve...

15:52.920 --> 15:54.710
I said, what the heck do you want?!

15:55.080 --> 16:01.170
Oh... m-my apologies. She, uh...
looked extraordinarily like the woman I love.

16:03.750 --> 16:09.250
No, it's faint, but I definitely smell Eve.
But this world has yet to-

16:09.790 --> 16:13.000
Has her fate become intertwined with
someone other than mine? No, that can't be...

16:13.250 --> 16:14.170
"Smell"?

16:14.420 --> 16:16.710
What the heck do you mean.
Were you just hitting on her?

16:16.710 --> 16:19.380
N-no! I would never do anything so inappropriate!

16:20.500 --> 16:22.080
You see... well...

16:22.330 --> 16:23.170
I'm...

16:24.330 --> 16:25.880
Kirise Kuon?!

16:25.880 --> 16:27.830
Huh, I swear I know you from somewh-

16:29.210 --> 16:31.330
<b>Daily A.M.</b>

16:29.210 --> 16:31.330
<b>The Special!</b>

16:29.210 --> 16:31.330
<b>It's a</b>

16:29.210 --> 16:31.330
<b>beautiful</b>

16:29.210 --> 16:31.330
<b>day for</b>

16:29.210 --> 16:31.330
<b>going out!</b>

16:29.210 --> 16:31.330
<b>Who is</b>

16:29.220 --> 16:31.330
<b>the most popular</b>

16:29.220 --> 16:31.330
<b>pop star actor</b>

16:29.220 --> 16:31.330
<b>right now?</b>

16:29.220 --> 16:31.330
<b>Kirise Kuon</b>

16:29.540 --> 16:30.710
I just saw you!

16:31.580 --> 16:36.080
That's right. I have an image to uphold,
so I would never carelessly hit on anyone.

16:36.790 --> 16:38.080
I apologize for startling you.

16:38.080 --> 16:44.580
It's just, I haven't seen my love in so long and
I've been lonely. I think I got a bit confused.

16:45.040 --> 16:48.250
I see. Well, we had better get on going.

16:51.040 --> 16:52.880
Are you sure? You don't want an autograph?

16:52.880 --> 16:53.960
Not interested.

16:53.960 --> 16:57.170
Agh, we're really gonna be late. Let's hurry!

16:57.170 --> 16:58.080
O-okay!

17:03.420 --> 17:04.920
Why eggplant?!

17:11.130 --> 17:12.420
Uh...

17:15.000 --> 17:18.210
I know I wasn't thinking clearly,
but I can't believe I held her like that!

17:18.380 --> 17:21.960
She was so delicate. And smelled insanely nice!

17:22.210 --> 17:25.460
Wow, I'm being gross. But the memory of
that sensation is enough to keep me going.

17:25.460 --> 17:26.290
Hey, Endo.

17:26.290 --> 17:26.880
Uh!

17:27.250 --> 17:28.170
What are you getting?

17:28.170 --> 17:29.380
O-oh... um...

17:29.540 --> 17:30.380
This, please.

17:31.880 --> 17:36.040
Why did I get this? Of all the options,
why choose this when I don't like eggplant?!

17:36.040 --> 17:39.540
Thanks so much for earlier.
I'm so glad I was with you, Endo.

17:39.670 --> 17:43.290
Uh, well... What do you think was up with him?

17:44.080 --> 17:48.790
Hmm... you can't help but wonder, right?
It being Kirise Kuon and all.

17:49.080 --> 17:49.790
Huh?

17:50.080 --> 17:52.830
Oh, that's right. You wouldn't know!

17:53.080 --> 17:57.670
See, Kirise Kuon might have
something to do with Magikoi, too.

17:57.880 --> 17:58.880
Him?

17:59.130 --> 18:04.710
So Magikoi has this thing called the God Route
that only unlocks after completing all the other routes.

18:04.710 --> 18:05.920
A hidden one.

18:05.920 --> 18:07.330
"God Route"?

18:07.540 --> 18:08.420
Yeah.

18:08.420 --> 18:13.420
It's where Fiene learns to hear
the Voices of the Gods and falls in love with a god.

18:13.790 --> 18:20.330
In that ending, the god takes Fiene as his bride
and whisks her away to his own world,

18:20.830 --> 18:24.210
but it looks an awful lot like our version of modern Japan.

18:24.580 --> 18:30.630
And the god is this total hottie who goes to
W University while making it big as an actor,

18:30.630 --> 18:32.210
and his name is Kuon.

18:32.210 --> 18:32.710
Huh.

18:32.710 --> 18:37.210
<b>Alternate Dimension</b>

18:32.710 --> 18:37.210
<b>Kuon appeared!</b>

18:33.290 --> 18:36.920
The character is like a direct copy of Kirise Kuon's bio.

18:37.420 --> 18:43.710
There was a lot of talk among fans that Magikoi must
have modeled the character after him without permission.

18:43.960 --> 18:44.750
Eve!

18:45.290 --> 18:47.210
What do you think he meant by "Eve"?

18:47.420 --> 18:49.210
Yeah, I dunno...

18:49.420 --> 18:52.420
If he had called me Fiene,
that would've been the giveaway.

18:52.830 --> 18:54.630
But it's just kinda weird, you know?

18:55.000 --> 18:55.830
Yeah...

18:56.830 --> 19:01.080
Oh, sorry. We're supposed to be celebrating!
Let's stop talking about this!

19:01.330 --> 19:05.580
By the way, you keep pushing all your eggplant
to the side. Do you not care for it?

19:06.630 --> 19:07.880
No, uh...!

19:07.880 --> 19:08.670
Hmm?

19:09.960 --> 19:12.210
It would be so lame for me to leave these.

19:13.790 --> 19:16.460
More importantly though,
I'm worried about what Bal's gonna do.

19:16.790 --> 19:18.750
Yeah, I was thinking the same thing.

19:21.880 --> 19:24.130
And so, I finished those eggplants off.

19:26.380 --> 19:27.170
Keep it coming!

19:27.420 --> 19:30.130
This is nothing compared to how strong Miss Fiene was.

19:32.170 --> 19:33.960
I must get stronger.

19:34.330 --> 19:36.250
Strong enough to protect Miss Fiene!

19:38.040 --> 19:39.460
Time to get back to the game!

19:39.460 --> 19:42.750
Our goal: to get to the best happy end
to end all happy ends!

19:43.630 --> 19:45.710
You're as enthusiastic as ever, Kobayashi.

19:46.330 --> 19:49.210
Though you were super cute yesterday, too.

19:49.210 --> 19:50.250
What?!

19:50.920 --> 19:52.710
Oh Endo, come on!

19:52.710 --> 19:53.710
Ow!

19:53.710 --> 19:56.250
Jeez! Come on, jeez!

19:53.830 --> 19:56.540
Ouch. Hey, that hurts, Kobayashi!

20:02.330 --> 20:07.000
Prince Siegwald, what have you been idling around for?

20:07.170 --> 20:09.880
It's now well past the time you were supposed to set off.

20:10.210 --> 20:11.330
I don't want to go back.

20:12.080 --> 20:12.790
What?

20:13.170 --> 20:15.210
Whatever do you mean by that, Your Highness?

20:15.710 --> 20:19.130
Once I return, I'll have to get back to work.
I just don't want to.

20:21.920 --> 20:22.540
Huh?

20:23.040 --> 20:28.540
F-forgive me. It's so rare to see
Your Highness looking like that.

20:28.960 --> 20:30.210
Are you disappointed in me?

20:30.210 --> 20:30.790
What?

20:31.250 --> 20:33.830
I understand my responsibilities as crown prince,

20:34.210 --> 20:36.710
but I, too, have moments when I'm vulnerable,

20:36.710 --> 20:39.460
or when I wish I could say what I want or what I truly feel.

20:40.670 --> 20:44.210
The few days I spent here were
so enjoyable. I hate to leave.

20:45.210 --> 20:47.420
And I loathe having to be apart from you.

20:50.420 --> 20:52.170
Will you not miss me?

20:55.040 --> 20:57.670
W-well, I... Er...

20:58.000 --> 21:00.170
Ooh! What's this, Lieselotte?

21:00.540 --> 21:03.580
Looks like a case of
"her heart pounding so much, it hurts"!

21:03.580 --> 21:08.920
The perfect Prince Charming acting this vulnerable?
It's crazy how endearing it is to see that gap!

21:08.920 --> 21:13.540
Right now, I think Liese-tan's joy at having Sieg
open up to her and her love for him has exploded,

21:13.540 --> 21:16.080
rendering her completely speechless.

21:18.080 --> 21:20.790
Um... I should give you this.

21:23.080 --> 21:23.790
What's this?

21:23.790 --> 21:25.290
She finally gave it to him!

21:25.290 --> 21:27.330
Open up that handkerchief!

21:32.750 --> 21:33.830
This ribbon...

21:34.750 --> 21:38.130
I-it's but the crude work of an amateur,

21:38.540 --> 21:41.420
but having agreed to do it I have no choice...

21:41.420 --> 21:43.460
no choice but to hand it over!

21:44.670 --> 21:47.960
She says that, but she did a ton
of trial attempts beforehand.

21:48.210 --> 21:52.750
She made several dozen and
carefully chose the best of the bunch!

21:53.920 --> 21:55.420
Thank you, Lieselotte.

21:55.880 --> 21:58.540
I'll think of this ribbon as you and
look to it to keep me going!

21:58.960 --> 22:03.630
N-now, you really must get going!
The others have been waiting for-

22:04.290 --> 22:06.670
So long, then. Until the next semester.

22:08.460 --> 22:09.210
Yes.

22:21.670 --> 22:26.000
The way their relationship is going...
They're gonna be okay, right?

22:32.540 --> 22:34.080
Lady Kobayashee?

22:35.670 --> 22:41.830
The words she uttered planted a small seed
of uneasiness and foreboding in my soul.

22:43.670 --> 22:49.670
Your smile is so stunning it almost hurts

22:49.670 --> 22:55.330
Even now, I can't look at it straight on

22:55.790 --> 23:01.920
The feelings scattered in the depths of my heart

23:01.920 --> 23:07.580
It's as if I'm gathering them bit by bit

23:08.540 --> 23:14.290
Do the stars in the night sky

23:15.290 --> 23:20.380
...see everything? ...know everything?

23:21.460 --> 23:27.000
I open the window and ask of them

23:27.630 --> 23:31.000
Why?

23:32.790 --> 23:38.960
This world is filled with glimmering light

23:39.080 --> 23:45.080
It was your smile that taught me so

23:45.080 --> 23:51.080
I can't help but wish for a happy ending

23:51.460 --> 24:01.290
If only I can stay by your side

24:01.290 --> 24:03.130
Forevermore

24:07.500 --> 24:09.460
Forevermore

24:14.170 --> 24:15.420
Miss Fiene.

24:15.580 --> 24:16.500
My dear sister!

24:16.790 --> 24:18.540
I'm so very happy.

24:18.920 --> 24:20.040
Same here!

24:20.750 --> 24:23.710
Next Episode: A Nightmare, the Coward,
and the Princess Carry.

24:24.040 --> 24:26.630
Sieg and Bal are gonna have
a tough time getting between these two!

24:24.920 --> 24:27.960
<b>A Nightmare, the Coward, and the Princess Carry</b>
